        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Why Linux Containers (LXC)</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1024px;\n    height: 768px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 22px 30px 0 30px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 31px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: -0.3px;\n    margin: 0 0 0 22px;\n    color: #111111;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .logo.placeholder {\n    width: 86px;\n    height: 30px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    color: #9aa0a6;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      #b8bcc4 0px, #b8bcc4 3px,\n      #ffffff 3px, #ffffff 5px\n    );\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .rule {\n    margin: 14px 0 0 0;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #cfd6de;\n  }\n  .content {\n    margin: 22px 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  ul.lvl1 {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.lvl1 > li {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 30px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  ul.lvl1 > li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 10px;\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #4f81bd;\n  }\n  ul.lvl2 {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.lvl2 > li {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 28px;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  ul.lvl2 > li::before {\n    content: \"\\2013\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 30px;\n    right: 30px;\n    bottom: 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: #8a8f98;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .footer .center {\n    color: #8a8f98;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .footer .page {\n    color: #8a8f98;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  sup {\n    font-size: 0.65em;\n    vertical-align: super;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"slide\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Why Linux Containers (LXC)</h1>\n    <div class=\"logo placeholder\">[Logo: IBM, top-right]</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <ul class=\"lvl1\">\n      <li>Fast\n        <ul class=\"lvl2\">\n          <li>Runtime performance near bare metal speeds</li>\n          <li>Management operations (run, stop , start, etc.) in seconds / milliseconds</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Agile\n        <ul class=\"lvl2\">\n          <li>VM-like agility &ndash; it&rsquo;s still &ldquo;virtualization&rdquo;</li>\n          <li>Seamlessly &ldquo;migrate&rdquo; between virtual and bare metal environments</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Flexible\n        <ul class=\"lvl2\">\n          <li>Containerize a &ldquo;system&rdquo;</li>\n          <li>Containerize &ldquo;application(s)&rdquo;</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Lightweight\n        <ul class=\"lvl2\">\n          <li>Just enough Operating System (JeOS)</li>\n          <li>Minimal per container penalty</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Inexpensive\n        <ul class=\"lvl2\">\n          <li>Open source &ndash; free &ndash; lower TCO</li>\n          <li>Supported with out-of-the-box modern Linux kernel</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>Ecosystem\n        <ul class=\"lvl2\">\n          <li>Growing in popularity</li>\n          <li>Vibrant community &amp; numerous 3<sup>rd</sup> party apps</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"date\">5/11/2014</div>\n    <div class=\"center\">Document v2.0</div>\n    <div class=\"page\">5</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
